# Modo visual obrigatorio: requer instalacao Geant4 com suporte Qt e WSLg funcional.
/run/initialize
/vis/open OGL
/vis/drawVolume
/vis/viewer/set/viewpointThetaPhi 65 20
/vis/viewer/set/style wireframe
/vis/scene/add/trajectories smooth
/vis/scene/endOfEventAction accumulate
/vis/viewer/set/autoRefresh true

